=== controlled comparison parameters ===
universe: AAA for single-name; Y_coin/BBB for pairs; fill=next-open via shift(1); Rf=0
costs: one-way stack 10.0 bps (+ √impact for single-name); pairs 2× stack
OOS: last 30% bars
baseline: dual_MA 10 30
cite: JoinQuant research ethos — same interrogation for every strategy
cite: quants.md open library (read 2026-11-04) — many cards print Sharpe≤0; use as foils not proof

